+# Matches 16-digit credit card numbers, either without separators or with
+# groups of 4 digits consistently separated by spaces or by hyphens.
+# Note that this does not validate the Luhn checksum nor the card issuer.
+credit_card = Regex(r"\d{16}|\d{4}-\d{4}-\d{4}-\d{4}|\d{4} \d{4} \d{4} \d{4}")
